<title>USA: Frankfort First delays reverse stock split.</title>
<headline>Frankfort First delays reverse stock split.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFORT, Ky. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frankfort First Bancorp Inc said Tuesday that it delayed the effective date of its previously announced one-for-two reverse stock split from July 15, 1997 to a date to be determined.</p>
<p>The company said it expected the date to be set in the second quarter of fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>The company said the move was made in order to get shareholder approval at the company's 1997 annual meeting in November.</p>
<p>Frankfort First Bancorp is the holding company of First Federal Savings Bank of Frankfort.</p>
